# P114 on WSL / Linux GTK: the Back key (XF86Back through xdotool) and Alt+Left pop the NavigationStack. Steps wait 3 s, as P114-back-labels does under WSLg. Mouse button 8 is checked with `xdotool click 8`, not in this file.
# Pushes go through the drawn controls (taplabel); the pops use the keys named in each row. One Back at the root must change nothing.
# Pass: the replay reports replayed; the log shows depths 1 2 3 2 1 0 1 in that order (no second 0); the final capture shows the Fruits screen under a "‹ Home" back control. DRAFT: written on macOS and not yet run on this platform.
# P114 在 WSL / Linux GTK 上：返回鍵(經 xdotool 的 XF86Back)與 Alt+Left 彈出 NavigationStack。步驟之間等 3 秒，與 WSLg 下的 P114-back-labels 相同。button 8 以 `xdotool click 8` 檢查，不在本檔中。草稿：在 macOS 上寫成，尚未在此平台執行。
